---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout meta={{ title: "Home" }}>
	<section>
		<h1 class="title mb-6">Manas Ganti</h1>
		<p class="mb-4">
			I'm a research engineer working on <strong>RL environments and post-training</strong> for
			language and vision-language models. I build environments where the reward is mechanically
			verifiable, then train models against them with SFT and GRPO on multi-GPU clusters, at scales
			from 7B to 32B.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Most of the work is in measuring things before trusting them. That means leak-checking
			benchmarks until surface features score at chance, computing an optimal ceiling that tells me
			when a policy is cheating, and gating every expensive run behind a cheap check. When a training
			run doesn't move the metric, I write down why. Several of my
			<a class="cactus-link" href="/projects/">projects</a> are exactly that.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Before this, I spent years shipping computer-vision models to production, on Jetson edge
			devices and in clinical imaging pipelines. I'm currently a grad student in Computer
			Engineering at Virginia Tech.
		</p>
		<SocialList />
	</section>
</PageLayout>
